      "id": "claim_0075abfefb7a4b069f3d4b28eddd5958",
      "statement": "The base DocumentLoader.convert_to_images returns single images as page 0 and rasterizes PDFs with pypdfium2 at scale 300/72 into per-page JPEG bytes, applying LANCZOS downscaling only when max_image_size is set (default None).",
