    {
      "id": "claim_35b8d61931844b95b0fa9d444744d485",
      "statement": "Vision loads from URLs are captured as full-page headless Chromium screenshots via Playwright (with a best-effort cookie-banner click and configurable screenshot_timeout) and split into 1000-pixel vertical PNG chunks that all map to page 0; missing Playwright raises an ImportError with installation instructions.",
